"Failed :ref:`tippy-gv-developer-testing-image-tests` are captured via the "
"``pytest-pyvista`` plugin option ``--failed_image_dir`` (see :ref:`tippy-gv-"
"developer-testing-image-tests-generation`), and uploaded and archived as a "
":fab:`github` `Workflow Artifact`_ for the CI job. The failed unit test "
"images may then be downloaded for analysis and investigation."
